+/// Whether an account request's answer ends the login: a 401 for the Authorization the app still
+/// keeps. A login sets the user name before it stores its token, and the account settings answer
+/// the new name with a request that may go out with the token from before; that request's 401
+/// must not end the new login.
+bool hjvEndsLogin(int status, {required String? sent, required String? kept}) =>
+    status == 401 && sent == kept;
