+/// The logout dialog's text (design v3 §1-7): on a PC this user's login bound, logging out also
+/// takes it out of the list.
+String hjvLogoutText(HjvTexts t, String tip, {required bool boundHere}) =>
+    boundHere ? '${t.logoutUnbinds}\n$tip' : tip;
